ed by his Cherokee heritage, Tommy awakens spiritual powers that let his spirit leave his body to slip past obstacles and even return from death. Armed with strange alien weapons and traversing dizzying corridors of shifting gravity and warping portals, he fights through the Sphere's monstrous inhabitants with a single desperate goal: to find Jen and escape the nightmare that has swallowed them.", "summary": "Prey tells the story of Tommy, a Cherokee garage mechanic stuck on a reservation going nowhere. Abducted along with his people to a menacing mothership orbiting Earth, he sets out to save himself and his girlfriend and eventually his planet.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/prey", "videos": [{"id": 3067, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "w0dygfEfTjs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w0dygfEfTjs", "title": "Prey - Gameplay Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/w0dygfEfTjs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 3068, "name": "Portals Trailer", "video_id": "zpQRePtEpRw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zpQRePtEpRw", "title": "Prey - Portals Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zpQRePtEpRw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 3069, "name": "Super Trailer", "video_id": "EPgzxSeRsiM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EPgzxSeRsiM", "title": "Prey - Super Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EPgzxSeRsiM/sddefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 102, "name": "Prey"}], "characters": [{"id": 10665, "name": "Abducted"}, {"id": 6116, "mug_shot": {"id": 3671, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/cbmtrmdbqafvziv34sbq.jpg"}, "name": "Chuck"}, {"id": 1609, "name": "Jen"}, {"id": 10670, "name": "Additional Female Voices"}, {"id": 10663, "name": "Elhuit"}, {"id": 2836, "name": "Hunters"}, {"id": 10666, "name": "Panicked Airline Pilot"}, {"id": 10662, "name": "Sphere"}, {"id": 10669, "name": "News Radio Announcer"}, {"id": 27